window.products.push({"id":137017,"name":"Prop and Stop – Front Load Washer Door Holder: Dry Properly/Prevent Odors! with Set of Whimsical Instruction Magnets (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J8Ox1EIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STOPS WASHER ODOR - PROP and STOP holds your washer door slightly ajar, so that air can circulate in and out, promoting proper drying. That musty odor coming from your front-load washer is caused by residual moisture inside the unit and on the rubber door seal. Moisture can promote those nasty odors and they can even transfer to your clean clothes! - YUCK! PROP your door and STOP the odor! ONE-PIECE, SIMPLE and EASY TO USE - PROP and STOP's compact, soft one-piece design makes it the most universal and easy-to-use washer door prop on the market. FULL FUNCTION - With two strong rubber covered magnet ends, PROP and STOP attaches to both your washing machine's inside door frame and to the door, keeping the door from swinging open or closing. EASY TO USE/UNIVERSAL - Works with almost all washers. Included 3M adhesive backed magnetic Catch Disks provide secure attachment to even non-magnetic washer doors and/or frames. You choose where to place your PROP and STOP, to adjust for the door opening that works best for you! SAFE FOR YOUR WASHER - Soft, flexible silicone rubber, with an open \"spring-like\" design lets the PROP and STOP move with your washer door just like a little shock absorber. This protects your washer from damage if the door is accidentally bumped or leaned into. STAYS ATTACHED - PROP and STOP is designed to stay attached, even if your washer door is bumped by a passing dog or child.  You can even open the door to add clothes without having to remove or readjust it.  Just close the door again, and your handy little PROP and STOP goes right back to doing its job! EASY TO STORE - When not in use, simply stick it out of the way just about anywhere on your washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J8Ox1EIDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Super Peel","source_asin":"B08QBLY7XS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QBLY7XS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QBLY7XS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
