window.products.push({"id":137279,"name":"W10258275 Bimetal Thermal Fuse and 661566 Thermostat Including Simple Instruction, Compatible with Kenmore, Maytag and Amana Dishwasher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IdkqZ5rXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dishwasher replacement including 661566 thermostat and W10258275 bimetal thermal fuse with instructions  Model No. 661566 thermostat: Replace part No.: 661566, WP661566, 3371618, W10339474, AP6010246, PS11743423  Function: Keeps the dryer from overheating, once the dryer temperature reaches a certain point, 661566 thermostat will shut down power to the heating element, it works as a safety mechanism.  When should replace your old 661566 thermostat? 1. Not drying dishes properly 2. Will Not Start 3. Not cleaning dishes properly 4. Door latch failure  Model No. W10258275 dishwasher bimetal thermal fuse: Replace part No.: 1549751, 661663, AP4423189, W10136048, W10258275, W10258275VP, W10344801, PS2360984  Function: Protect the dishwasher circuit from overload, once the temperature gets to high, it will quickly shut off the electrical current to the heating unit in the appliance.  When should replace your old W10258275 bimetal fuse? 1. Will Not Start. 2. Not draining.  Package includes: 1 x 661566 Thermostat 1 x W10258275 Bimetal thermal fuse Please note: These dryer replacements are not original aftermarket parts; The mention of any related models and brads above is only for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. Please refer to your old part No. before order to ensure purchase correct model.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IdkqZ5rXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jetec","source_asin":"B07M5CL1JZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137279","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07M5CL1JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07M5CL1JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
