window.products.push({"id":137365,"name":"Portable Countertop Dishwasher, 5 Washing Programs Mini Dishwasher with 5L Built-in Water Tank & Inlet Hose, Baby Care & Fruit Wash for Small Apartmen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":263.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A84+UBJgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portable Countertop Dishwasher, 5 Washing Programs Mini Dishwasher with 5 L Built-in Water Tank & Inlet Hose, Baby Care, Glass & Fruit Wash for Small Apartment, Dorms, RVs -White Do you worry that it takes a lot of time to wash the dishes every time, taking up your leisure time after meals? This compact dishwasher can free your hands, and you only need to take a little time to hand wash after dinner. The dishwasher only needs one and a half gallons of water to help you wash dishes, saving water, electricity, and detergent. While maximizing cleaning performance, allowing you to enjoy the joy of family freely, no more worry about washing dishes. 【Note】 All dishwashers are factory tested to ensure proper operation. As a result, it is normal for small amounts of residual water to be found in the unit.Please do not move the dishwasher while operating or paused. Only move it when the water tank is completely drained.A water hose is included for a direct hookup to the kitchen faucet. (adapter not included)Detergents: Pods, Liquid, or Powder Detergents are All Acceptable, and It's Recommended only to Use Detergent Tablets When Running Long Cycles so the Tablets Fully Dissolve. 【Dishwasher Specifications】 Product: 16.9 x 16.7 x 18.0 inches Weight: ‎26.4 lbs Voltage: 120V Noise：50dB Frequency: 60Hz Energy Use：0.38 Kilowatt Hours 【Accessories Included:】 Storage rack x 1 Cutlery basket x1 Tableware basket x1 Fruit basket x1 Inlet hose x1 Drain hose x1 Hose collar x1 Pitcher x1 User manual x1 【How to clean a dishwasher?】 To keep your dishwasher clean, place a cup of distilled white vinegar in the upper rack and run the machine through a hot water cycle. Do this once every two to three weeks to keep your machine clean effortlessly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A84+UBJgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"None branded","source_asin":"B091CPV463","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091CPV463","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B091CPV463","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
