window.products.push({"id":137383,"name":"Upgraded 600 CFM Range Hood 30 inch, Under Cabinet Range Hood for Duct/Ductless Convertible, Stainless Steel Stove Vent Hood with 3 Speed Kitchen Exha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uDP+fofZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Powerful Air Flow: Complete with 600 CFM with dual motors are more powerful than most competitors. Kitchen exhaust fans system are made for heavy duty cooking that can easily suck away large amounts of grease, heat, smoke and cooking odor lingering in your home within minutes. Stainless steel range hood 30inch provides 3 speeds at low, medium, and high. Only 55dB max noise level. Contemporary & Slim Design: Whether you’re remodeling your entire kitchen or just upgrading appliances, TYLZA range hood 30 inch with stylish design and extremely space saving, great for condos and apartments.With its 0.7mm-thickness stainless steel, kitchen hood contains rust, temperature, and corrosion-resistant properties to ensure a durable vent hood that will last for years to come. Duct/Ductless Convertible Range Hood : The exhaust fan designed for outdoor vented (duct) or indoor vented (ductless) installations. Stove hood vent is suitable for top or rear venting, and you can install under a cabinet or against a wall. Two carbon filters (Included) available for ductless use. Easy to Install and Clean: Range hoods are easy for the Do-It-Yourself to install by following step-by-step instructions in the user manual. Or you may choose to have the installation and electrical wiring completed done by qualified professionals. 5-layers baffle filters can capture grease more effectively, which makes cleanup a breeze. 2 Bright energy-saving white LED lights can provide sufficient lighting to illuminate your cooking area. Great After-sales Service Support: As we attach great importance and care about customer using experience. Customer satisfaction is our greatest pursuit. We provide 3 years manufacturer warranty together with your purchase. Professional team to offer you efficient and timely after-sales service for range hood. If you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uDP+fofZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tylza","source_asin":"B09ZV1KP57","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZV1KP57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZV1KP57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
