window.products.push({"id":137407,"name":"Frigidaire Professional FPIC3077RF 30\" ADA Compliant Induction Cooktop with 4 Elements, PowerPlus Induction Technology, SpacePro Bridge Element, and K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lIPWKZtES._AC_.jpg","description":"The Frigidaire Professional 30-Inch ADA Compliant Induction Cooktop offers 4 powerful elements so you can cook all your food at once. Unit features PowerPlus induction technology, SpacePro bridge element, and knob controls. Features: Maximize your time with PowerPlus induction technology boil water in less than 2 minutes so you can shave time off cooking dinner every day. Gas benefits, without remodeling Our PowerPlus induction cooktop offers the speed, control and consistency of gas, without the need to convert your cooktop from electric to gas. Flexible Cooking SpacePro Bridge Element allows you to cook two separate dishes at once, or combine elements for large pots or griddle use. The plate adapts to the size of the pan, whether it is a small pot, a large frying pan or a grill. Consistent Results Even heat removes hot spots and delivers consistent results to create delicious, evenly cooked foods like steaks and omelettes. Cool Cooking, Easy Clean The cool-touch cooktop generates heat directly into the pan, not the cooktop, so spills can't burn. The controlled cooking adjusts from a powerful boil to a gentle cook instantly, ideal for rice, soups and sauces. Professional-grade controls offer precise temperature control whether you're simmering, sautéing, boiling. Efficient use of power The cooktop heats the pan directly so less heat is lost in the cooking process. Induction compatible cookware, includes most stainless steel or iron cookware. If a magnet sticks to the bottom of the cooker, it's compatible. Meets ADA requirements specified in the Americans with Disabilities Act.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31lIPWKZtES._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frigidaire","source_asin":"B086Z5YM1T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086Z5YM1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B086Z5YM1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
