window.products.push({"id":137708,"name":"Dryer Door Handle Whirlpool Maytag Amana W10861225 Replacement Wed49stbw1 Wed5000dw2 Medx655dw1 Wed4815ew1 Ned4655ew1 Medc215ew1 Wed7300dw1 Ngd4655ew2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hovnT7AeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 W10861225 Dryer Door Handle - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5999398, 4380739, PS11731583, W10714516, W10861225VP. W10861225 Door Handle For Whirlpool Dryer comes in white color, made of durable plastic. Door Handle W10861225 is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Inglis, Kenmore, Maytag, Roper appliances. It is an essential component of the dryer door, allowing users to easily open and close the door during operation. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Whirpool Dryer Handle W10861225? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Ultra Durable W10861225 will help if your door doesn't open or close. Replace it if the locking tab has broken off. W10861225 Handle can be replaced in a few simple steps, making it a convenient solution for anyone who needs to replace a broken or damaged dryer handle. 💡 W10861225 Whirlpool Appliance Handle is a replacement handle designed for use with dryers. Whirlpool Dryer Part W10861225 is made of durable materials and is built to withstand the rigors of everyday use. It is designed to fit snugly into the allotted space on the dryer door and to snap securely into place. Dryer Handle W10861225 replacement solution meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How do you replace a dryer handle? To replace a dryer handle, open the door and use a Philips head screwdriver to remove the two screws. Remove the inner and outer panels of the door and detach the current handle by pulling up on both retaining tabs. Insert the new Whirlpool Dryer Handle W10861225 into place and press firmly until it snaps securely. Reconnect the panels and screw everything back together. 💡 Dryer Door Handle W10861225 fits hundreds of models. It is important to ensure that the replacement handle is compatible with your dryer model. Popular models: ned4655ew1, ngd4655ew2, wed7300dw1, medc215ew1, medc465hw0, medx655dw1, ned4705ew1, ngd4655ew1, red4516fw0, wed4815ew1, wed4850hw0, wed49stbw1, wed5000dw2, wgd4815ew2, wgd7000dw1, wgd4815ew1, wed4915ew1, wed7000dw1, wgd5000dw2, 110.65132411, 110.60222511, wgd4810ew1.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hovnT7AeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07J63TJFX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J63TJFX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J63TJFX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
