window.products.push({"id":137832,"name":"Antoble 285753A Motor Coupling Kit Replacement - Exact Fit for Whirlpool & Kenmore Washer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KCq54ffHL._AC_.jpg","description":"The direct drive 285753A motor coupling, also known as a coupling kit, is a newer version of the part and is used in your washer. The piece includes new metal sleeves that have been added in order to strengthen the part. This part works between the transmission and the motor; it is only used on direct drive washers with no belt. In order to replace this part, you will need a flat blade screw driver, a quarter inch nut driver, and a Phillips screw driver. Before making this repair remember to disconnect the power supply, and both fill hoses. SPECIFICATIONS - The 285753A motor coupling replacement kit is for direct drive washing machine - Fits most motor coupler styles and versions of Whirlpool & Kenmore washer - Replace part number:1195967, 21003, 280152, 285140, 285743, 285753, 285753A, 285753AVP, 3352470, 3363664, 3364002, 3364003, 62672, 62693, 661560, 80008, 8559748, AP3963893, ER285753, SB285753A. - Includes three-part piece, a coupling for the motor and one for the transmission Works with most top name brands: Whirlpool, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Roper, Estate, Inglis, Crosley, Amana, Maytag, Admiral, Magic Chef. Fixes the following symptoms:  Pumps but will not spin.  Will not agitate.  Noisy. Spins slowly.  Will not drain.  Burning smell.  Will Not Start.  Shakes and moves.  Leaking.  Touchpad does not respond.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41KCq54ffHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANTOBLE","source_asin":"B0736L6PP8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0736L6PP8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0736L6PP8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
