window.products.push({"id":137853,"name":"PETSITE 2-in-1 Ice Maker Water Dispenser Countertop, Portable Electronic Ice Cube Machine with Water Cooler Dispenser, 48 LBS/Day, 3 Size Ice Cube, Fa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SbV-7l7QL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ice Maker with Water Dispenser: Our 2-in-1 water ice maker can be used as an ice maker for chilled beverages, or as a water dispenser, with water coming out of the cold water faucet on the side so you can enjoy cold water whenever you want. High Efficiency Ice Maker: Powered by a powerful compressor, our ice maker comes in three ice cube sizes, takes 6-12 minutes to make ice, and produces 48 lbs of ice per 24 hours for home use. Aside from that, the 5-pound ice storage basket can hold a substantial amount of ice cubes. Easy-to-operate Control Panel: The control panel allows you to select from three ice cube sizes, ranging from small to large, to meet your specific needs. The power indicator, add water indicator, and full ice indicator help you stay on top of the ice-making situation, and the operation is simple and straightforward. Materials and Accessories of High Quality: The ice maker has a multi-layer shell: the outer layer is made of stainless steel, the middle layer is made of insulating material, and the inner layer is made of plastic, which effectively isolates heat. It also includes an ice scoop for easy removal of ice cubes. 2 Ways to Add Water: For water supply, place a 2-5 gallon barreled water (not included) on the top of the ice maker. Furthermore, you can manually add water from the top or remove the ice basket to directly pour water into the 2 L water tank. Any question, please contact our customer service for help.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SbV-7l7QL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PETSITE","source_asin":"B0B18SR56M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B18SR56M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B18SR56M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
