window.products.push({"id":137928,"name":"Magic Chef HMDR450SE Double Door Mini Refrigerator Stainless Look 4.5 cu. ft.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MtAyNM5lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Whether you're college-bound or simply want a little extra refrigerator space in your home, office, or break room, the Magic Chef 2 Door, 4.5 cu. ft. Energy Star Compact Refrigerator has the food storage options you're looking for. A can rack conveniently keeps beverage cans in the door while additional door shelves provide space for other frequently used items. Glass refrigerator shelves and a pull out crisper keep foods organized and are easy to clean. The separate top freezer compartment provides additional storage for frozen foods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MtAyNM5lL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Magic Chef","source_asin":"B07JNJMGJ7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JNJMGJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JNJMGJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":137929,"name":"Refrigerator Air Filter Replacement 2-Pack with Activated Carbon – Compatible with Frigidaire PureAir Ultra PAULTRA and All Electrolux Models SCPUREAI","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZ-Fz5ONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's the hardest-working appliance in your home. The simple replacement of your refrigerator's air filter will help maintain its energy efficiency while also keeping it healthy and odor-free. Our activated carbon air filters for Frigidaire PureAir Ultra and Electrolux refrigerators ensure that you can switch out those old, dirty filters every 6 months as recommended by the manufacturer. With a premium fridge filter at work to capture particulates, it deters unpleasant odors and helps extend the life of foods. Designed for maximum efficiency - Unlike other filters that are made outside the USA and sprayed with paint, our filters are produced under strict quality standards with an abundance of carbon particles. The activated carbon and natural zeolite neutralize and suppress odor-causing molecules, sparing you from those occasions when you open the fridge door and are met with foul smells. Fast and easy to replace - Our filters install without need for tools or expertise. First, remove and discard the old filter. Then remove the perforated panel from the new filter and slide it into the air filter compartment with the activated carbon side facing down. Close the compartment and be sure to reset the air filter notification on the control panel on the outside of the refrigerator door. With a new activated carbon refrigerator filter in place, you're assured that only clean, fresh air will be circulating around your meats, produce and cheeses. To ensure your refrigerator's peak performance, add an activated carbon charcoal odor absorber Refrigerator Air Filter 2-Pack today. Fits Electrolux models 241754001, 241754002, 242047801, 242047804, 242061001 E132AR Series, E123CS Series, E124RD Series, E23BC Series, EW26S Series and EAFCBF. Fits Tier 1 model RAF1150 Fits Frigidaire models PAULTRA, PureAdvantage and SCPUREAIRU PartSelect part number PS199382","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZ-Fz5ONL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRESH HEADQUARTERS","source_asin":"B07VHS84MR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-137929","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VHS84MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VHS84MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
